        "created_at": "2013-05-09T00:30:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While I love Bunker's main cards, I agree that we need more versions of the suits. &nbsp;Obviously the first suit didn't hold up if Fright Train became the new Bunker in the Shattered Timeline. &nbsp;But then it begs the question. &nbsp;If the heroes prevent the shattered timeline, does Fright Train never become a good guy?</p>",
